  Note over RECV: BR-047 (medium): Route DB2 recovery requests by recovery request type · SME review

  alt uncertain: connection recovery (type C)
    loop up to 3 reconnect attempts (until retry count reaches the maximum)
      %% REVFORGE-ID RECV statement_id=SYS-PORTFOLIO-001-FIL-0061-STMT-000008 paragraph_id=SYS-PORTFOLIO-001-FIL-0061-PAR-0004
      RECV->>ONLN: CICS LINK — connect request
      Note over ONLN: BR-046 (confirmed): Enforce maximum of 100 active online DB2 connections
      opt active connections below the limit of 100
        ONLN->>DB2: SQL CONNECT to POSMVP
      end
      ONLN-->>RECV: return — response code
      Note over RECV: uncertain: response code test uses a qualified name with no Field ID
      alt reconnect succeeded
        Note over RECV: BR-048 (high): Stop reconnect attempts at the first successful reconnect
        RECV->>RECV: leave the retry loop
      else reconnect failed
        RECV->>RECV: wait retry interval (CICS DELAY)
      end
    end
    opt retry count reached the maximum
      RECV->>RECV: mark recovery failed (response code -1)
    end
    Note over RECV: BR-049 (confirmed): Cap connection recovery at 3 reconnect attempts
  else uncertain: transaction recovery (type T)
    RECV->>DB2: SQL ROLLBACK
    alt rollback succeeded (SQL code 0)
      RECV->>RECV: mark recovery successful
    else rollback failed
      RECV->>RECV: mark recovery failed with the SQL code
    end
  else uncertain: cursor recovery (RECV-CURSOR, name not unique)
